.TH flightlog-push 1 2026-09-29 "flightlog 0.2.2" "flightlog manual"
.SH NAME
flightlog\-push \- Upload a bundle to a presigned URL (validated first)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBflightlog push\fR [\fB\-\-skip\-path\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-size\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-url\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-checksums\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-format\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-content\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-overwrite\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-http\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-unredacted\fR] [\fB\-\-yolo\fR] [\fB\-\-redact\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Upload a bundle to a presigned URL (validated first)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-path\-checks\fR
Allow traversal, absolute destinations and filesystem symlinks
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Presigned upload URL (HTTP PUT)
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-size\-checks\fR
Disable Flightlog archive, entry and input size limits
.TP
\fB\-\-url\-file\fR \fI<URL_FILE>\fR
Read the signed URL from a private file, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-checksums\fR
Ignore manifest SHA\-256 mismatches (ZIP decoding must still succeed)
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-format\-checks\fR
Skip bundle schema and file\-inventory validation
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-content\-checks\fR
Skip input redaction and opaque\-content checks, regardless of manifest mode
.TP
\fB\-\-overwrite\fR
Replace existing outputs and restore files; merge extraction directories
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-http\fR
Permit plaintext HTTP transfers
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-unredacted\fR
Accept explicitly unredacted bundles for private migration
.TP
\fB\-\-yolo\fR
Disable redaction and every bypassable safety check; overwrite outputs
.TP
\fB\-\-redact\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
File of private literal names/domains to redact (one per line; kept local)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
The .flightlog.zip
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flightlog (1)
